e + N+ -> N2+ + 2e. Cross section: Bell et al., J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 12, 891 (1983), Eq. (1), Table 5 N II (I = 29.60 eV, A = 1.0755, B = -0.8287, 0.8724, -0.1618, 1.5331; +-10 %), evaluated 29.60 eV-10 keV; held above (tail share 0.0000 % at 45 eV, 0.0000 % at 150 eV, 0.0000 % at 255 eV). Header 29.60125 eV = IE(N II), NIST ASD. Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n_plus_ionization_table.py). Evidence level 4. Reaction set abep-n2n-0.5.
